<!-- ==================== MY STORY SECTION ==================== -->
<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="section-heading">
                My <span class="text-gold">Story</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="lead text-muted">The journey that shaped my vision for real estate</p>
        </div>

        <div class="story-narrative mb-5">
            <p class="narrative-text">
                <strong>My passion for real estate began with a simple observation:</strong> Too many people were making 
                one of the biggest decisions of their lives—buying a property—with incomplete information and misguided advice. 
                I watched families stress over property deals, get caught in bureaucratic mazes, and lose trust in the process.
            </p>

            <p class="narrative-text">
                That's when I realized my purpose. I decided to become the bridge between dreams and reality, 
                the advocate for honest guidance, and the architect of transparent property transactions.
            </p>

            <p class="narrative-text">
                Over the past decade, I've dedicated myself to understanding Pune's real estate landscape intimately. 
                I've studied emerging neighborhoods, tracked market trends, built relationships with developers, and—most importantly—
                learned what truly matters to property seekers. This knowledge, combined with unwavering integrity, 
                became the foundation of PuneVistaRealestate.
            </p>

            <p class="narrative-text">
                <strong>Today, my mission is simple:</strong> Help every client make confident, informed, and rewarding 
                property decisions. Whether you're a first-time buyer, an experienced investor, or someone looking to sell, 
                I'm here to guide you with expertise, transparency, and genuine care.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
                <div class="story-card">
                    <div class="story-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="story-title">My Vision</h5>
                    <p class="story-text">
                        Making Pune a place where property buying, selling, and investing is transparent, 
                        rewarding, and accessible to everyone.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
                <div class="story-card">
                    <div class="story-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="story-title">My Approach</h5>
                    <p class="story-text">
                        Listen first, recommend second. I understand your needs before suggesting properties, 
                        ensuring perfect matches.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
                <div class="story-card">
                    <div class="story-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="story-title">My Commitment</h5>
                    <p class="story-text">
                        Transparent dealings, honest communication, and complete support at every step. 
                        Your trust is sacred.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
                <div class="story-card">
                    <div class="story-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5 class="story-title">My Results</h5>
                    <p class="story-text">
                        500+ satisfied clients, 10+ years of expertise, and a 4.9? rating that speaks 
                        for our dedication.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

